00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:40.320
This is a Komatsu
930E hauling trucks

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:46.380
and it's about $1 million
truck, so it's quite big.

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:48.450
It's quite big as you've
